---
title: Content OS Decision Flow
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph checks["Checks"]
    docs_ready{Docs complete?}
    cloud_ready{Cloud snapshot ready?}
    human_review{Human review needed?}
  end
  subgraph actions["Actions"]
    draft[Generate draft]
    request_input[/Request more input/]
    publish[/Publish deck/]
  end
  docs_ready -.->|yes| cloud_ready
  docs_ready -.->|no| request_input
  cloud_ready -.->|yes| draft
  cloud_ready -.->|no| request_input
  draft -.->|confidence < 0.9| human_review
  human_review -.->|no| publish
  human_review -.->|yes| request_input
  class docs_ready decision
  class cloud_ready decision
  class draft ai
  class human_review decision
  class request_input output
  class publish output
  classDef ai fill:#bddfd6,stroke:#2d6a68,color:#1f2937
  classDef decision fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#9c7a00,color:#1f2937
  classDef output fill:#fce5cd,stroke:#9b5f1b,color:#1f2937
  %% Notes
  %% Decision diagrams stay useful only when branches remain shallow and legible.
